pub trait NetworkPath:Send+Sync+'static{type Payload:Send+Sync+'static;fn present(p:&Self::Payload)->bool;fn zones(p:&Self::Payload)->&Vec<u32>;fn nodes(p:&Self::Payload)->&Vec<u32>;fn links(p:RetainedCloneRef<'_,Self::Payload>)->RetainedCloneRef<'_,Vec<u32>>;fn outdoor(p:&Self::Payload)->u32;}
/// ↩️ Exact prior presence, pair order, outdoor node and links form the authored parallel-array inverse.
#[derive(semio_framework_value::RetireOwned)]pub struct NetworkInverse{pub present:bool,pub zone_ids:Vec<u32>,pub node_ids:Vec<u32>,pub outdoor_node_id:u32,pub link_ids:Vec<u32>}
/// 🧳️ Every partial vector, immutable child, displaced singleton and output keeps its own funded closure.
pub struct NetworkPreparation<S:NetworkPath>{
 authored:Option<RetainedCloneBinding>,original:Option<RetainedCloneBinding>,body:Option<usize>,phase:u8,index:usize,outcome:Option<RowOutcome>,closing:bool,
 raw_pairs:ManuallyDrop<Option<Vec<Pair>>>,pairs:ManuallyDrop<Option<SealedShared<Vec<Pair>>>>,links:ManuallyDrop<Option<SealedShared<Vec<u32>>>>,value:ManuallyDrop<Option<OptionalNetwork>>,old:ManuallyDrop<Option<OptionalNetwork>>,branch:ManuallyDrop<Option<SealedShared<Systems>>>,decision:ManuallyDrop<Option<EnergyModelDiff>>,
 link_cursor:Option<Box<RetainedSealedField<Vec<u32>>>>,stage:Option<Box<RetainedBranchProjection<Systems>>>,output:Option<Box<DirectBranchOutput<Systems>>>,old_source:ManuallyDrop<Option<RetainedCloneSource<OptionalNetwork>>>,inverse:ManuallyDrop<Option<NetworkInverse>>,inverse_cursor:Option<Box<RetainedFieldPreparation<Vec<u32>>>>,inverse_phase:u8,inverse_index:usize,retirement:RetainedCloneClose,marker:std::marker::PhantomData<fn()->S>,
}
fn systems(o:RetainedCloneRef<'_,EnergyModelSnapshot>)->RetainedCloneRef<'_,Systems>{o.project(0,|s|s.model.systems.get())}
impl<S:NetworkPath> NetworkPreparation<S>{
 fn check_sources(&self,p:RetainedCloneRef<'_,S::Payload>,o:RetainedCloneRef<'_,EnergyModelSnapshot>)->Result<(),ValueError>{p.check_binding(&self.authored)?;o.check_binding(&self.original)?;Ok(())}
 fn quote(&self,p:RetainedCloneRef<'_,S::Payload>,o:RetainedCloneRef<'_,EnergyModelSnapshot>,b:usize)->Result<RetirementDemand,ValueError>{if self.closing||self.phase>=99||self.body.is_some_and(|v|v!=b){return Err(invalid())}self.check_sources(p,o)?;match self.phase{
 0=>nested(scalar(p.binding_copy_bytes()),1+size_of::<usize>()),1=>nested(scalar(o.binding_copy_bytes()),1),2|3|4=>Ok(scalar(2*size_of::<S::Payload>()+2*size_of::<Pair>()+4*size_of::<usize>()+4)),
 5=>Ok(RetirementDemand{copy_bytes:2*size_of::<Vec<Pair>>()+size_of::<usize>()+1,capacity_bytes:S::zones(p.get()).len().checked_mul(size_of::<Pair>()).ok_or_else(invalid)?,depth:1,..Default::default()}),6=>Ok(scalar(2*size_of::<Pair>()+2*size_of::<usize>()+1)),
 7=>Ok(RetirementDemand{copy_bytes:2*size_of::<Option<Vec<Pair>>>()+2*size_of::<Option<SealedShared<Vec<Pair>>>>()+1,capacity_bytes:SealedShared::<Vec<Pair>>::birth_bytes(),depth:1,..Default::default()}),8=>Ok(birth::<RetainedSealedField<Vec<u32>>>()),9=>nested(self.link_cursor.as_ref().ok_or_else(invalid)?.demand(S::links(p),b.saturating_sub(1))?,1),10=>nested(self.link_cursor.as_ref().ok_or_else(invalid)?.take_demand()?,2*size_of::<Option<SealedShared<Vec<u32>>>>()+1),
 11=>Ok(RetirementDemand{copy_bytes:3*size_of::<Network>()+2*size_of::<Option<OptionalNetwork>>()+1,capacity_bytes:SealedShared::<Network>::birth_bytes(),depth:1,..Default::default()}),12=>Ok(birth::<RetainedBranchProjection<Systems>>()),13|15=>nested(self.stage.as_ref().ok_or_else(invalid)?.demand(systems(o),b.saturating_sub(1))?,1),14=>nested(RetainedBranchProjection::<Systems>::exchange_demand::<OptionalNetwork>(),1),16=>nested(self.stage.as_ref().ok_or_else(invalid)?.take_demand()?,2*size_of::<Option<SealedShared<Systems>>>()+1),17=>cursor_demand(&self.stage,b),18=>Ok(birth::<DirectBranchOutput<Systems>>()),19=>nested(self.output.as_ref().ok_or_else(invalid)?.demand(&self.branch,o,b.saturating_sub(1))?,1),20=>nested(self.output.as_ref().ok_or_else(invalid)?.take_demand()?,2*size_of::<Option<EnergyModelDiff>>()+1),21=>cursor_demand(&self.output,b),_=>Err(invalid())}}
 fn step(&mut self,input:RetainedCloneRef<'_,S::Payload>,o:RetainedCloneRef<'_,EnergyModelSnapshot>,body:usize,g:RetainedCloneGrant)->Result<RetainedCloneStep,ValueError>{let d=self.quote(input,o,body)?;if !retained_mutation_demand_fits(d,g){return Ok(RetainedCloneStep::Progress(Default::default()))}let mut p=receipt(d);self.body=Some(body);let v=input.get();match self.phase{
 0=>{p=add(input.bind(&mut self.authored,child(g,1+size_of::<usize>()))?.ok_or_else(invalid)?,1+size_of::<usize>())?;self.phase=1;},1=>{p=add(o.bind(&mut self.original,child(g,1))?.ok_or_else(invalid)?,1)?;self.phase=2;},
 2=>{let before=&systems(o).get().airflow_network;let present=S::present(v);if S::zones(v).len()!=S::nodes(v).len()||!present&&(!S::zones(v).is_empty()||!S::links(input).get().is_empty()){self.outcome=Some(RowOutcome::Invalid);self.phase=99;}else if !present&&before.is_none(){self.outcome=Some(RowOutcome::Unchanged);self.phase=99;}else if !present{*self.value=Some(None);self.phase=12;}else if before.as_ref().is_some_and(|old|old.get().outdoor_node_id==S::outdoor(v)&&old.get().zone_node_ids.get().len()==S::zones(v).len()&&old.get().link_ids.get().len()==S::links(input).get().len()){self.index=0;self.phase=3;}else{self.phase=5;}},
 3=>{let old=systems(o).get().airflow_network.as_ref().ok_or_else(invalid)?.get();if self.index==S::zones(v).len(){self.index=0;self.phase=4;}else{let pair=old.zone_node_ids.get()[self.index];if pair.0.0!=S::zones(v)[self.index]||pair.1!=S::nodes(v)[self.index]{self.phase=5;}else{self.index+=1;}}},
 4=>{let old=systems(o).get().airflow_network.as_ref().ok_or_else(invalid)?.get();if self.index==S::links(input).get().len(){self.outcome=Some(RowOutcome::Unchanged);self.phase=99;}else if old.link_ids.get()[self.index]!=S::links(input).get()[self.index]{self.phase=5;}else{self.index+=1;}},
 5=>{*self.raw_pairs=Some(Vec::with_capacity(S::zones(v).len()));self.index=0;self.phase=6;},6=>{if self.index==S::zones(v).len(){self.phase=7;}else{self.raw_pairs.as_mut().ok_or_else(invalid)?.push((crate::model::EntityId(S::zones(v)[self.index]),S::nodes(v)[self.index]));self.index+=1;}},
 7=>{let birth=SealedShared::<Vec<Pair>>::prepare_birth(g)?;let(value,r)=birth.materialize(self.raw_pairs.take().ok_or_else(invalid)?,SharedIssuer::owned());*self.pairs=Some(value);p.retained_capacity_bytes=r.retained_capacity_bytes;self.phase=8;},8=>{self.link_cursor=Some(Box::new(RetainedSealedField::new()));self.phase=9;},9=>{let c=self.link_cursor.as_mut().ok_or_else(invalid)?;p=add(c.advance(S::links(input),body.saturating_sub(1),child(g,1)).map_err(|e|tag(e,1))?.progress(),1)?;if c.ready(){self.phase=10;}},10=>{let extra=2*size_of::<Option<SealedShared<Vec<u32>>>>()+1;let(value,r)=self.link_cursor.as_mut().ok_or_else(invalid)?.take(child(g,extra))?.ok_or_else(invalid)?;*self.links=Some(value);p=add(r,extra)?;self.phase=11;},
 11=>{let birth=SealedShared::<Network>::prepare_birth(g)?;let(value,r)=birth.materialize(Network{zone_node_ids:self.pairs.take().ok_or_else(invalid)?,outdoor_node_id:S::outdoor(v),link_ids:self.links.take().ok_or_else(invalid)?},SharedIssuer::owned());*self.value=Some(Some(value));p.retained_capacity_bytes=r.retained_capacity_bytes;self.phase=12;},12=>{self.stage=Some(Box::new(RetainedBranchProjection::new()));self.phase=13;},13|15=>{let c=self.stage.as_mut().ok_or_else(invalid)?;p=add(c.advance(systems(o),body.saturating_sub(1),child(g,1))?.progress(),1)?;if self.phase==13&&c.raw_ready(){self.phase=14;}else if self.phase==15&&c.ready(){self.phase=16;}},14=>{let c=self.stage.as_mut().ok_or_else(invalid)?;let(_,r)=c.exchange(|s|&mut s.airflow_network,&mut self.value,&mut self.old,child(g,1))?;p=add(r,1)?;c.begin_seal()?;self.phase=15;},16=>{let extra=2*size_of::<Option<SealedShared<Systems>>>()+1;let c=self.stage.as_mut().ok_or_else(invalid)?;let(value,r)=c.take(child(g,extra))?.ok_or_else(invalid)?;*self.branch=Some(value);c.begin_close();self.phase=17;p=add(r,extra)?;},17=>{p=close_cursor(&mut self.stage,g)?;if self.stage.is_none(){self.phase=18;}},18=>{self.output=Some(Box::new(DirectBranchOutput::new(|b|{let mut diff=EnergyModelDiff::default();diff.model.systems=Some(b);diff})));self.phase=19;},19=>{let c=self.output.as_mut().ok_or_else(invalid)?;p=add(c.advance(&mut self.branch,o,body.saturating_sub(1),child(g,1))?.progress(),1)?;if c.ready(){self.phase=20;}},20=>{let extra=2*size_of::<Option<EnergyModelDiff>>()+1;let c=self.output.as_mut().ok_or_else(invalid)?;let(value,r)=c.take(child(g,extra))?.ok_or_else(invalid)?;*self.decision=Some(value);c.begin_close();self.phase=21;p=add(r,extra)?;},21=>{p=close_cursor(&mut self.output,g)?;if self.output.is_none(){self.outcome=Some(RowOutcome::Changed);self.phase=99;}},_=>return Err(invalid())}semio_framework_value::retained_clone::admit_retained_clone_progress(g,p,"original native airflow network")?;Ok(if self.phase==99{RetainedCloneStep::Complete(p)}else{RetainedCloneStep::Progress(p)})}
}
